  "reason": "The declared map. Written on 16 November, after the two Madelon trails of 15 November (live/madelon-2026-11-15-1 and -2) had been read: the routes explain, l1 and forest were walked by those trails before this map existed, so they are not steered by it. The routes to the compact goal, and the screen milestone they share, were declared here before any run toward them.",
